===Etymology===
{{MF.}} ''laquais'', perhaps from {{etyl|pro}} {{term|lacai|lang=pro}}. Another possibility is through {{etyl|fr}} from {{etyl|ca}} {{term|alacay|lang=ca}}, from {{etyl|ar}} {{term|al-qadi|lang=ar}}. Third possibility is via {{etyl|es}} {{term|lacayo|lang=es}}, {{etyl|it}} {{term|lacchè|lang=it}} and {{etyl|el}} {{term||sc=Grek|tr=oulakes}}{{rfscript|Greek}}, from {{etyl|tr}} {{term|ulak|lang=tr}}. <ref>[http://www.etymonline.com/index.php?term=lackey "lackey."] Online Etymology Dictionary. 2008.</ref>

